  <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">Community Pharmacy Advanced Pharmacy Practice Experience (APPE)</h3>
  <p>Semester – {{ semester }} year</p>
  <p>Course #{{ course_code }} ({{ credit_hours }} credit hrs) / Track: Experiential Education</p>
  <p>6-weeks</p>

